          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\Delta&=b^{2}-4ac\\\\\\Delta&=3^{2}-4(2)(6)\\\\\\Delta&=-39\\end{aligned}$$\nSince $\\Delta<0$, there are no real solutions.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
